            <ArticleTitle>The Ombrelle-380 IUD: a pilot study.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>37-41</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The initial results of a pilot trial (314 insertions and 3784 woman-months of experience at 18 months) suggest the low expulsion rate (0.0) and high clinical effectiveness (pregnancy rate 0.0) of the Ombrelle-380, a new high-load copper-releasing IUD of French origin.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
